# Every checkout is LF, on every platform.
#
# `mix ex_mujoco.gen` writes LF and compares what it wrote against what is on
# disk; a runner that checks the repository out with CRLF reports every
# generated file as out of date. The C++ it emits is compiled by MSVC too, and
# MSVC reads LF without complaint.
* text=auto eol=lf
